DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->operators->undefine('+','-','*','/');
BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

What is the value of [`2+8-12+14/16`]? [_____]{answer=>Real(-1.125),width=>7}
---

[`10+10+18+9/16`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(38.5625),width=>6}
---

What is the value of [`12*5+11/16`]? [_____]{answer=>60.6875,width=>2}
---

What is the value of [`15+18+19/16`]? [_____]{34.1875}
---

[`3+7+18-11`] is equal to [_____]{Formula("17")}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
